=== jcmd ===
USAGE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  jcmd <pid | main class> <command ...|PerfCounter.print|-f file>
  jcmd -l
  jcmd -h


FLAGS (3) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
-f                read and execute commands from the file
-l                list JVM processes on the local machine
-?, --help print
 or -h
